%%{init: {"theme":"default"}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor PM as Project Manager
    participant SR as StaffingRequest
    participant Search as Candidate Search
    participant Profile as Resource Profile
    participant Alloc as Allocation
    participant Assign as Assignment
    participant Team as Team / Capacity

    PM->>SR: create staffing request
    SR->>Search: evaluate role, skills, dates, region
    Search->>Profile: fetch eligible resources and proficiency
    Search->>Team: inspect team availability and capacity
    Search-->>PM: ranked candidates

    PM->>Alloc: propose allocation / block capacity
    Alloc->>Team: reserve capacity
    Team-->>Alloc: approval or conflict warning
    Alloc->>SR: request approved / rejected

    alt approved
        PM->>Assign: create assignment for selected resource
        Assign->>Team: confirm operational commitment
        Team-->>Assign: assignment accepted
        Assign-->>PM: staffed plan ready
    else rejected
        PM->>Search: revise filters or find alternate candidate
    end
